input/articles.ndjson: synthetic edge cases, three real enwikinews-20261101 articles and fillers, so that with --workers 1 the second 32-job window starts with a deletion, an older copy and an empty body; input/hidden.txt: the hidden categories; input/ns14.ndjson: category pages. frames.json: page_html with the body's inner HTML replaced by \x00INNER\x00. expected/ and stdout.txt: the golden wikipedia run. hidden-stdout.txt: the golden hidden-categories output for input/ns14.ndjson. Read by bulk/wikipedia/tests/fixtures.rs.
